  "description": "Roslyn analyzer and code fix provider for migrating legacy .NET Framework codebases to .NET 6/8.\n      v0.2.0-alpha emits 42 diagnostic descriptors covering the full reserved ID range of three\n      sibling Rokstep migration shims: Ninject (RKSNI0001–RKSNI0015), ADAL (RKSAD0001–RKSAD0011),\n      and ELMAH (RKSEL0001–RKSEL0016). Each diagnostic offers up to three code fix paths:\n      (1) install the matching Rokstep.<Library>.Shims drop-in replacement package,\n      (2) migrate to an optimized modern Rokstep.<Library> library (planned for v0.3+),\n      or (3) migrate directly to the standard modern .NET alternative\n      (Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection, MSAL, Microsoft.Extensions.Logging plus an\n      error-tracking sink, etc.). A single package that grows with each new supported library —\n      EWS, WindowsAzure.Storage, Glimpse, and Enterprise Library rule families are planned for\n      later v0.x releases.",
